aged memory.","Recommendation":"Use <b>Physics2D.OverlapBoxNonAlloc()</b> instead.","DocumentationUrl":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/Physics2D.OverlapBoxAll.html"},{"Id":"PAC0024","Title":"UnityEngine.Physics2D.OverlapAreaAll","Areas":{"m_String":"Memory"},"Platforms":[],"Description":"<b>Physics2D.OverlapAreaAll()</b> allocates managed memory.","Recommendation":"Use <b>Physics2D.OverlapAreaNonAlloc()</b> instead.","DocumentationUrl":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/Physics2D.OverlapAreaAll.html"},{"Id":"PAC0025","Title":"UnityEngine.Physics2D.OverlapCapsuleAll","Areas":{"m_String":"Memory"},"Platforms":[],"Description":"<b>Physics2D.OverlapCapsuleAll()</b> allocates managed memory.","Recommendation":"Use <b>Physics2D.OverlapCapsuleNonAlloc()</b> instead.","DocumentationUrl":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/Physics2D.OverlapCapsuleAll.html"},{"Id":"PAC0026","Title":"UnityEngine.Component.GetComponentsInChildren","Areas":{"m_String":"Memory"},"Platforms":[],"Description":"<b>Component.GetComponentsInChildren()</b> allocates managed memory.","Recommendation":"Ensure you are using one of the versions of <b>GameObject.GetComponentsInChildren()</b> which accepts a List<T> as a parameter and populates it with the components it finds.","DocumentationUrl":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/Component.GetComponentsInChildren.html"},{"Id":"PAC0027","Title":"UnityEngine.Component.GetComponentsInParent","Areas":{"m_String":"Memory"},"Platforms":[],"Description":"<b>Component.GetComponentsInParent()</b> allocates managed memory.","Recommendation":"Ensure you are using one of the versions of <b>GameObject.GetComponentsInParent()</b> which accepts a List<T> as a parameter and populates it with the components it finds.","DocumentationUrl":"https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/Component.GetComponentsInParent.html"},{"Id":"PAC0028","Title":"UnityEngine.GameObject.GetComponentsInChildren","Areas":{"m_String":"Memory"},"Platforms":[],"Description